msgstr ""
"Uzi neza ko ushaka gukuraho urufunguzo rwa TOTP? Iki gikorwa kizahagarika "
"kwemeza TOTP kuri iki kintu."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:681
